@startuml
title Idempotency V1.1 - Component Overview

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Idempotency API" as API {
  [IdempotencyExecutor]
  [IdempotencyRecoveryQueryService]
  [IdempotencyRequestHasher]
}

component "Idempotency Core" as CORE {
  [DefaultIdempotencyExecutor]
  [RepositoryRegistry]
  [RecoveryQueryService]
}

component "Optional Coordination" as COORD {
  [DistributedLockClient]
}

component "State Providers" as PROVIDERS {
  [RedisIdempotencyRepository\nSHORT_TERM]
  [JdbcIdempotencyRepository\nDURABLE]
}

component "Future External Components" as FUTURE {
  [Reliable Task]
  [Transaction Template]
  [Data Routing]
}

API --> CORE
CORE --> COORD : optional short lock
CORE --> PROVIDERS : required state correctness
[RecoveryQueryService] --> [JdbcIdempotencyRepository\nDURABLE]
[Reliable Task] --> [IdempotencyRecoveryQueryService] : scan candidates
[Reliable Task] --> [IdempotencyExecutor] : recover()
[Transaction Template] ..> [JdbcIdempotencyRepository\nDURABLE] : transaction-aware JdbcExecutionManager
[Data Routing] ..> [JdbcIdempotencyRepository\nDURABLE] : routeKey -> shard

note bottom of PROVIDERS
Repository 是正确性核心：
Redis 使用 Lua；JDBC 使用 UNIQUE / row lock / CAS。
end note

@enduml
